listing:   startup.cc app.cc i2c_bitbang.h board.h, input app.in
toolchain: Ubuntu clang version 18.1.3 (1ubuntu1); Ubuntu LLD 18.1.3 (compatible with GNU linkers); QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18)
